I can show you an I.D. If you want.

152
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:40,260
Oh, no. You look a lot different than the last time I saw you.

153
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:43,390
Oh, yeah. Well, I just started wearing bras again.

154
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:45,940
Oh, that must be it.

155
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,730
Have fun tonight.

156
00:08:48,940 --> 00:08:50,150
Thanks. You too.

157
00:08:56,910 --> 00:08:58,160
You said she was bald.

158
