169
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:45,290
Ooh. Barely got you that time. Get over here!

170
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Come on.

171
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:49,210
Oh, yeah! Good one.

172
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:52,000
That was a good one. Keep at it, team!

173
