Hey.

184
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:29,040
God, Ross! What is that?

185
00:10:29,290 --> 00:10:30,920
The Ultimate Fighting Combo.

186
00:10:31,130 --> 00:10:34,210
I saved 30 cents. Plus I get to keep the cup. Yay!

187
00:10:36,550 --> 00:10:38,880
AFrom New York City, New York...

188
00:10:39,130 --> 00:10:43,260
...appearing in his Ultimate Fighting Championship debut...

189
00:10:43,510 --> 00:10:47,270
...he's known for his confrontational business style!

190
00:10:48,430 --> 00:10:51,900
Ladies and gentlemen, introducing...

191
00:10:52,100 --> 00:10:54,610
...Pete Becker!

192
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,660
I love you, Pete!

193
00:11:05,740 --> 00:11:09,790
And his opponent from Huntington Beach, California...

194
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:13,790
...he's a 300-pound street fighter...

195
