199
00:11:37,070 --> 00:11:41,320
Well, then that guy is in serious, serious trouble.

200
00:11:46,410 --> 00:11:48,200
You go get him. Let's go!

201
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:51,250
Here we go, gentlemen.

202
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:52,830
Are you ready?

203
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:58,500
Are you ready? Then let's get it on!

204
00:12:20,650 --> 00:12:21,820
It's me.

205
00:12:22,740 --> 00:12:24,450
Monica.

206
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,830
Can I just tell you how proud I am of you?

207
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:34,080
It would be nice after hearing 20,000 people chant, "You suck!"

208
00:12:35,290 --> 00:12:37,290
I thought you were nuts at first...

209
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:39,090
...but you did it.

210
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:42,510
Now you can just look back at this with no regrets.

211
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:44,170
Look back?

212
00:12:44,970 --> 00:12:46,840
You're not gonna keep going?

213
00:12:47,180 --> 00:12:50,930
Let me ask you a question: Am I the Ultimate Fighting Champion?

214
00:12:53,020 --> 00:12:54,680
Well, no. But...

215
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:58,270
I'm not gonna stop until I'm the Ultimate Fighting Champion.

216
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:03,150
That guy stood on your neck until you passed out.

217
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:05,650
Let me tell you a story.

218
00:13:06,530 --> 00:13:10,870
When I set out to create MOSS 865, do you think it happened overnight?

219
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:15,540
No. There was MOSS 1 that burned down my dad's garage.

220
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:19,710
There was MOSS 2 that would only schedule appointments in January.

221
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:22,210
And 862 others that I learned from.

222
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:26,220
Just like I learned from this fight never to let a guy stand on my neck.

223
00:13:26,510 --> 00:13:28,720
You didn't know that already?

224
00:13:30,220 --> 00:13:32,220
Look, I'm gonna get better.

225
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:35,180
Okay? I promise you.

226
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:37,560
Okay.

227
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:41,230
Just get a lot better.

228
00:13:41,690 --> 00:13:43,070
Fast.

229
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,320
One other thing.

230
00:13:46,570 --> 00:13:50,240
Hoshi thinks you being ringside may have affected my concentration.

231
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,240
Yeah.

232
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:54,240
That was the problem.

233
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:03,750
- How long until Pete's fight?     - About five minutes.

234
