237
00:14:14,180 --> 00:14:15,770
I'm really nervous.

238
00:14:16,730 --> 00:14:17,770
Thank you.

239
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:23,190
So how did it go with Bonnie?

240
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:27,610
Oh, I gotta tell you, I wasn't expecting to like her at all.

241
00:14:27,860 --> 00:14:30,780
